&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Then, we get the address , following the flag format we got : &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SIBER25{ulitsa_sovetskaya-chaykovsky-perm_krai-russia}&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The suspect was last seen located near mall named ТЦ (Мега).&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Siber Siaga 2025: Preliminary</title><link>https://rizzykun.github.io/p/siber-siaga-2025-preliminary/</link><pubDate>Mon, 22 Sep 2025 11:45:47 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://rizzykun.github.io/p/siber-siaga-2025-preliminary/</guid><description>&lt;img src="https://rizzykun.github.io/p/siber-siaga-2025-preliminary/img-01.png" alt="Featured image of post Siber Siaga 2025: Preliminary" /&gt;&lt;h1 id="challenge-5--dumpster-diving"&gt;&lt;a href="#challenge-5--dumpster-diving" class="header-anchor"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;Challenge 5 : Dumpster Diving
